# Summary

The charter states that each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter [[cite:obs-485ea7e3c5de753ed1c3bd5a0a14223f769fb50a "Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter."]].

The annex specifies that ordinary contributions are one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January [[cite:obs-cc7c85331d729c9f9e50665d91a2e81bb78f7d22 "Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January."]].
